==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|la|en}} future passive participle '''[[reverendus]]''', from deponent verb '''[[revereri]]''', ''honor'' or ''revere''.

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|en-us-reverend.ogg|Audio (US)}}

===Adjective===
'''reverend'''

# [[worthy]] of [[reverence]] or [[respect]]

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# a member of the [[Christian]] [[clergy]]

